\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab Let us join-'tis God commands
\par \pard\li720 Let us join our hearts and hands ;
\par Help to gain our calling's hope,
\par Build we each athe other up :
\par Still forget the things behind,
\par Follow Christ in heart and mind,
\par Toward the mark unwearied press,
\par Seize the crown of righteousness.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab While we walk with God in light,
\par \pard\li720 God our hearts doth still unite ;
\par Dearest fellowship we prove,
\par Fellowship in Jesu's love
\par Sweetly each, with each combined,
\par In the bonds of duty joined,
\par Feels the cleansing blood applied,
\par Daily feels that Christ hath died.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab Still, O Lord, our faith increase,
\par \pard\li720 Cleanse from all unrighteousness :
\par Thee the unholy cannot see ;
\par Make, O make us meet for Thee !
\par Every vile affection kill, 
\par Root out every seed of ill,
\par Utterly abolish sin,
\par Write thy law of love within.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab Hence may all our actions flow,
\par \pard\li720 Love the proof that Christ we know;
\par Mutual love the token be,
\par Lord, that we belong to Thee :
\par Love, Thine image, love impart !
\par Stamp it on our face and heart !
\par Only love to us be given !
\par Lord, we ask no other heaven.
\par \pard 
\par 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

